{"4957570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lucy and Mercy- Holy Hell", "steam_appid": 4957570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/5decc92b3af09713dc3a5891877a4eae.avif?t=1785892092\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hell! Join Lucy and Mercy, each with their own mission, as you fight your way through the many levels of this dark dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way out of Hell's darkest prison. The damned with claw and tear at you. Choose to save their souls or consume them and gain power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/264c1de8249b3bb4cc3805a6e76adadc.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/264c1de8249b3bb4cc3805a6e76adadc.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is safe in Hell and sometimes its better the devil you know than the one you don't. With little choice an angel must them up with a devil and kick, punch, grapple and blast their way through the underworld. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/06e5dfdd2e576847137b1805dcb86d35.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/06e5dfdd2e576847137b1805dcb86d35.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will battle your way across some of the many layers of Hell and quickly found out that there is more to this place than just fire and brimstone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/f5f482db42336ade7754ff82ab24a2ab.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/f5f482db42336ade7754ff82ab24a2ab.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are places in the dark that even demons fear and creature not wished to be found again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/62d3bfbd794405594865197ef3e3d861.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/62d3bfbd794405594865197ef3e3d861.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle you way through Hell and even go up against Satan. But not stop fighting because there are many faces to evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/46e89b650ba5267233305eae5eabea19.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/46e89b650ba5267233305eae5eabea19.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be brave and go into battle alone or grab a friend and if not a friend, an enemy of your enemy and fight like hell.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/d6bb72ff147b37d779b6dbe38d1e2d69.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/d6bb72ff147b37d779b6dbe38d1e2d69.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May God have mercy on your soul, for you enemies will not.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/5decc92b3af09713dc3a5891877a4eae.avif?t=1785892092\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Hell! Join Lucy and Mercy, each with their own mission, as you fight your way through the many levels of this dark dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way out of Hell's darkest prison. The damned with claw and tear at you. Choose to save their souls or consume them and gain power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/264c1de8249b3bb4cc3805a6e76adadc.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/264c1de8249b3bb4cc3805a6e76adadc.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is safe in Hell and sometimes its better the devil you know than the one you don't. With little choice an angel must them up with a devil and kick, punch, grapple and blast their way through the underworld. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/06e5dfdd2e576847137b1805dcb86d35.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/06e5dfdd2e576847137b1805dcb86d35.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will battle your way across some of the many layers of Hell and quickly found out that there is more to this place than just fire and brimstone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/f5f482db42336ade7754ff82ab24a2ab.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/f5f482db42336ade7754ff82ab24a2ab.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are places in the dark that even demons fear and creature not wished to be found again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/62d3bfbd794405594865197ef3e3d861.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/62d3bfbd794405594865197ef3e3d861.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle you way through Hell and even go up against Satan. But not stop fighting because there are many faces to evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/46e89b650ba5267233305eae5eabea19.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/46e89b650ba5267233305eae5eabea19.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be brave and go into battle alone or grab a friend and if not a friend, an enemy of your enemy and fight like hell.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras/d6bb72ff147b37d779b6dbe38d1e2d69.avif?t=1785892092\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/extras_big/d6bb72ff147b37d779b6dbe38d1e2d69.webp?t=1785892092 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >May God have mercy on your soul, for you enemies will not.</p>", "short_description": "Sometimes its better the devil you know than the one you don't. Join the angel of mercy and a devil named Lucy, fight their way through Hell and face some of the worst things ever. One has a hidden mission and the other has a hidden agenda.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/38d580005adf9e8e710f11bf3d10ede9f4060d53/header.jpg?t=1785892092", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/7e8f482a6fc69a5a734cb3eefa03c69b7c305cd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785892092", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4957570/7e8f482a6fc69a5a734cb3eefa03c69b7c305cd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785892092", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce 9600 GT or AMD HD 3870<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 or Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Darrin Hickey"], "publishers": ["Darrin Hickey"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, 